OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy but dry. Perhaps an
OL,6,Foccasional bright spell, mainly in the
OL,7,Fnorth. A gentle breeze, and feeling
OL,8,Fcool with temperatures close to
OL,9,Faverage for the time of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy and dry this
OL,12,Fevening and overnight. Winds easing to
OL,13,Fa light breeze. Feeling chilly during
OL,14,Fthe evening and overnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FAnother cloudy day, with fewer
OL,17,Fbright breaks than on Thursday.
OL,18,FRemaining dry for most, though patches
OL,19,Fof light rain may edge into the
OL,20,Fsouthwest during the morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
