OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCool
OL,6,Fand cloudy conditions persisting
OL,7,Fthrough Saturday, with showers for
OL,8,Fsome. Becoming increasingly clear
OL,9,Fthrough Sunday and Monday with
OL,10,Fpleasant autumnal sunshine, and colder
OL,11,Fnights bringing frost and fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
